  "rulesText": "A weapon’s feature is a special rule that stays in effect while the weapon is equipped.\n\nYou can throw an equipped weapon at a target within Very Close range, making the attack roll with Finesse. On a success, deal damage as usual for that weapon. Once thrown, the weapon is no longer considered equipped. Until you retrieve and re-equip it, you can’t attack with it or benefit from its features.",
